---
// Privacy Policy (English / Traditional Chinese shared component)
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { getLocaleFromPath, type Locale } from '../../i18n';

const locale = getLocaleFromPath(Astro.url.pathname);
const ZH = locale === 'zh-hant';

const legalEntity = 'Incinta Reproductive Fertility Center';
const brandAbbrev = 'IRFC';

const sections = [
  {
    id: 'collect',
    title: 'Information We Collect',
    titleZh: '我們蒐集的資訊',
    body: [
      'When you visit our website, we may collect personal information such as your name, email address, and phone number if you choose to provide it to us through our contact forms or email addresses. We may also collect PHI, such as health status, medical history, and treatment information, if you voluntarily provide it to us for the purpose of receiving healthcare services. We also collect non-personal information such as your IP address, browser type, and operating system.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '當您訪問我們的網站時，如果您選擇透過我們的聯絡表單或電子郵件提供，我們可能會蒐集您的個人資訊，例如您的姓名、電子郵件地址和電話號碼。如果您自願向我們提供以接受醫療服務，我們也可能會蒐集 PHI，例如健康狀況、病史和治療資訊。我們還會蒐集非個人資訊，例如您的 IP 位址、瀏覽器類型和作業系統。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'use',
    title: 'How We Use Your Information',
    titleZh: '我們如何使用您的資訊',
    body: [
      'We use your personal information, including Protected Health Information (PHI), to provide you with healthcare services and to manage our operations. This includes scheduling appointments, providing treatment, billing and payment processing, and maintaining medical records.',
      'We may also use your personal information to respond to inquiries, provide requested information, and send you newsletters and updates about our services.',
      'With your explicit consent, we may use your email address to send you marketing communications. We may also use your email address to create custom audiences on platforms such as Facebook or Instagram, allowing us to serve relevant ads based on your interests and prior interactions with our website. By providing your email address, you consent to these uses and acknowledge that your information will be handled in accordance with this Privacy Policy.',
      'In the future, with your consent, we may also use your phone number to send SMS text messages for marketing, appointment reminders, or important service updates. Standard messaging rates may apply. You may opt out of marketing communications at any time by following the instructions provided or contacting our office directly.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們使用您的個人資訊（包括受保護健康資訊 PHI）來向您提供醫療服務並管理我們的營運。這包括安排預約、提供治療、帳單與付款處理以及維護病歷。',
      '我們也可能使用您的個人資訊來回覆查詢、提供要求的資訊，以及向您發送有關我們服務的通訊和更新。',
      '在您明確同意的情況下，我們可能會使用您的電子郵件地址向您發送行銷通訊。我們也可能使用您的電子郵件地址在 Facebook 或 Instagram 等平台上建立自定義受眾，以便根據您的興趣和先前與我們網站的互動向您投放相關廣告。透過提供您的電子郵件地址，您同意這些用途並承認您的資訊將根據本隱私權政策進行處理。',
      '未來在您同意的情況下，我們也可能使用您的電話號碼發送用於行銷、預約提醒或重要服務更新的簡訊。可能適用標準訊息費率。您可以隨時按照提供的說明或直接聯絡我們的辦公室，選擇退出行銷通訊。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'disclosure',
    title: 'Disclosure of Information',
    titleZh: '資訊揭露',
    body: [
      'We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information, including PHI, to outside parties without your consent, except as required by law or for the purposes of treatment, payment, or healthcare operations. We may disclose your personal information to our trusted third-party service providers who assist us in providing healthcare services or conducting our business.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們不會在未經您同意的情況下出售、交易或以其他方式將您的個人資訊（包括 PHI）轉讓給外部方，但法律要求或出於治療、付款或醫療營運的目的除外。我們可能會向協助我們提供醫療服務或經營業務的可信第三方服務提供者披露您的個人資訊。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'security',
    title: 'Security of Information',
    titleZh: '資訊安全',
    body: [
      'We take reasonable measures to protect the security of your personal information, including PHI, but no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. We comply with HIPAA’s security and privacy regulations, including technical, administrative, and physical safeguards to protect PHI.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們採取合理措施保護您的個人資訊（包括 PHI）的安全，但網際網路上的任何傳輸方式或電子儲存方式都不是 100% 安全的。我們遵守 HIPAA 的安全與隱私規範，包括保護 PHI 的技術、行政和實體防護措施。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'cookies',
    title: 'Cookies',
    titleZh: 'Cookie 使用',
    body: [
      'We use cookies to enhance your user experience and to understand how you interact with our website. You can choose to disable cookies in your browser settings, but this may affect the functionality of our website.',
      'We use third-party services such as Google Analytics and Google Tag Manager to collect aggregate data about how users interact with our website. This data helps us improve user experience and evaluate the effectiveness of our marketing campaigns. These services may track your IP address, time spent on site, referral source, and pages visited.',
      'You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on. For more information about how Google uses your data, please review Google’s Privacy Policy.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們使用 Cookie 來增進您的使用者體驗並了解您如何與我們的網站互動。您可以選擇在瀏覽器設定中停用 Cookie，但這可能會影響我們網站的功能。',
      '我們使用第三方服務（例如 Google Analytics 和 Google Tag Manager）來收集有關使用者如何與我們網站互動的彙總資料。這些資料有助於我們改善使用者體驗並評估行銷活動的成效。這些服務可能會追蹤您的 IP 位址、停留時間、參照來源和瀏覽過的頁面。',
      '您可以透過安裝 Google Analytics 停用瀏覽器外掛程式來選擇退出 Google Analytics 追蹤。有關 Google 如何使用您的資料的更多資訊，請參閱 Google 的隱私權政策。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'third-party',
    title: 'Third-Party Websites',
    titleZh: '第三方網站',
    body: [
      'Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these websites.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們的網站可能包含指向第三方網站的連結。我們對這些網站的隱私權實務或內容概不負責。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'baa',
    title: 'Business Associate Agreements',
    titleZh: '業務夥伴協議',
    body: [
      'We sign Business Associate Agreements (BAAs) with all third-party companies that handle PHI to ensure that they are complying with HIPAA regulations and safeguarding the PHI they handle. These agreements outline the specific requirements for protecting the privacy and security of PHI and set forth the legal obligations for our business associates to comply with these requirements.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們與所有處理 PHI 的第三方公司簽署業務夥伴協議（BAA），以確保他們遵守 HIPAA 規範並保護所處理的 PHI。這些協議概述了保護 PHI 隱私和安全的具體要求，並規定了我們的業務夥伴遵守這些要求的法律義務。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'children',
    title: "Children's Privacy",
    titleZh: '兒童隱私',
    body: [
      'We do not knowingly collect or use any personal information from children under the age of 13. If we become aware that we have collected such information, we will take steps to delete it.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們不會蓄意蒐集或使用 13 歲以下兒童的任何個人資訊。如果我們發現我們已蒐集此類資訊，我們將採取步驟予以刪除。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'retention',
    title: 'Data Retention Policy',
    titleZh: '資料保留政策',
    body: [
      'We retain personal data for as long as necessary to provide the services requested by you, or for other essential purposes such as complying with legal obligations and resolving disputes.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們會在提供您要求的服務所需的期間內，或出於遵守法律義務和解決爭議等其他重要目的，保留個人資料。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'international',
    title: 'International Data Transfer',
    titleZh: '國際資料傳輸',
    body: [
      'Your information may be transferred to and maintained on computers located outside of your state, province, country, or other governmental jurisdiction where the data protection laws may differ from those of your jurisdiction.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '您的資訊可能會被傳輸並保存在您所在的州、省、國家或其他政府管轄區之外的電腦上，這些管轄區的資料保護法律可能與您管轄區的法律不同。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'subject',
    title: 'Data Subject Rights',
    titleZh: '資料主體權利',
    body: [
      'You have the right to access, correct, delete, or transfer your personal data that we hold. You can exercise these rights by contacting us at the details provided below.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '您有權存取、更正、刪除或轉移我們所持有的您的個人資料。您可以透過以下提供的聯絡方式與我們聯繫來行使這些權利。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'changes',
    title: 'Changes to Privacy Policy',
    titleZh: '隱私權政策變更',
    body: [
      'We reserve the right to modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with a revised effective date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '我們保留隨時修改本隱私權政策的權利。變更將發布在此頁面上並附上修訂後的生效日期。我們鼓勵您定期審查本政策。',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'contact',
    title: 'Contact Us',
    titleZh: '聯絡我們',
    body: [
      'If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us by phone.',
    ],
    bodyZh: [
      '如果您對本隱私權政策或我們的隱私實務有任何疑問，請透過電話與我們聯繫。',
    ],
  },
];

const title = ZH ? '隱私權政策' : 'Privacy Policy';
const description = ZH
  ? `${legalEntity}（${brandAbbrev}）的隱私權政策，說明我們如何蒐集、使用與揭露您的個人及健康資訊。`
  : `Privacy Policy for ${legalEntity} (${brandAbbrev}), explaining how we collect, use, and disclose your personal and health information.`;
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Nav />

  <section class="pt-40 pb-16" style="background: var(--color-pearl-100);">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-5" style="color: var(--color-gold-text); font-family: var(--font-sans);">
        {ZH ? '法律' : 'Legal'}
      </p>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-6 leading-tight">
        {title}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-stone-500 font-light leading-relaxed">
        {ZH
          ? `${legalEntity}（${brandAbbrev}）致力於保護網站訪客的隱私，包含我們可能收到的任何受保護健康資訊（PHI）。本隱私權政策說明我們如何蒐集、使用與揭露 PHI 及其他個人資訊。`
          : `At ${legalEntity} (${brandAbbrev}), we are committed to protecting the privacy of our website visitors, including any Protected Health Information (PHI) that we may receive. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose PHI and other personal information.`}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16" style="background: var(--color-pearl-50);">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">

      {sections.map((section) => (
        <div class="mb-12" id={section.id}>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-2xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-4">
            {ZH ? section.titleZh : section.title}
          </h2>
          {(ZH ? section.bodyZh : section.body).map((para) => (
            <p class="text-stone-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">{para}</p>
          ))}
        </div>
      ))}

      <div class="pt-10" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-pearl-300);">
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-2xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-4">
          {ZH ? '聯絡方式' : 'Contact Us'}
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-2">{legalEntity} ({brandAbbrev})</p>
        <p class="text-stone-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-2">
          16300 Sand Canyon Avenue, 9th Floor, Irvine, CA 92618
        </p>
        <p class="text-stone-500 font-light leading-relaxed">
          <a href="tel:4244324732" class="hover:underline" style="color: var(--color-champagne-700);">(424) 432-IRFC</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
